{{!
    Clickable choices below a clarification message: when a request matches several entries, each
    choice is a button; clicking it sends its query as the next message.

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js into the clarification bubble, after its text.

    @template bookingextension_agent/ambiguity_options

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * options - List of choices, each with:
      * query - The text that is sent when the button is clicked (also the tooltip).
      * label - The button text.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "options": [
            {"query": "booking rules", "label": "Booking rules"},
            {"query": "booking options", "label": "Booking options"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-ai-ambiguity-options mt-3 p-3 border rounded bg-light">
    <div class="font-weight-bold mb-1">{{#str}}ai_js_ambiguity_heading, bookingextension_agent{{/str}}</div>
    <div class="small text-muted mb-2">{{#str}}ai_js_ambiguity_intro, bookingextension_agent{{/str}}</div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap">
        {{#options}}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary mr-2 mb-2 booking-ai-ambiguity-option" data-query="{{query}}" title="{{query}}">{{label}}</button>
        {{/options}}
    </div>
</div>
